WELCOME TO SUNAGAKURE, THE HIDDEN SAND VILLAGE
A word to every new shinobi, in the name of the Fifth Kazekage.

You now stand among the shinobi of the Sand, sworn to the Land of Wind. Ours is
a village forged in a hard country: sheltered within the great rock basin,
sustained by rationed water, and defended by the fiercest wind-users and the most
cunning puppeteers in all the nations.

Know your village:
- We are led by Lord Gaara, the Fifth Kazekage, who protects Sunagakure with his
  own person and has led us from an age of fear into one of trust.
- Our arts are the wind and the puppet. Our discipline is the desert.
- Our closest bond is the alliance with Konohagakure, the Hidden Leaf, sealed in
  hardship and honored today.

You will train hard, ration carefully, and stand with your squad. Carry the Sand
headband with pride; it marks you as one who endures where others cannot. The
Kazekage himself welcomes you. Report to your assigned instructor and begin.
